  "prefLabel": "Emab 202.05 The Record on Appeal",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Emab 202.05 The Record on Appeal. Pursuant to RSA 282-A:64, III, the commissioner shall provide the appellate board with a copy of all records related to the claim. If technologically and administratively feasible, records shall be transmitted in electronic format upon request.\n\nSource. #10394, eff 8-9-13",
